  "markdown": "# \ud83c\udfc1 F1 POST-RACE DEBRIEF: HUNGARIAN GRAND PRIX\n**Location**: Hungaroring | **Date**: 2026-07-26\n\n---\n\n### \ud83d\udcca TELEMETRY & STRATEGY RECAP\n- **[Telemetry Pace] Race Pace Champion** (*-0.182s / lap*)\n  McLaren logged the fastest average clean-air pace (+0.182s/lap over Ferrari), building a crucial 4.2s gap in stint 2 on Medium tyres.\n\n- **[Tyre Wear] Tyre Degradation Rate** (*0.035s / lap deg*)\n  Hard compound (C2) showed remarkably low degradation of 0.035s/lap over a 28-lap stint, enabling a successful 1-stop strategy.\n\n- **[Pit Wall] Fastest Pitstop Performance** (*1.98s Stop*)\n  Red Bull Racing executed the fastest stationary pit stop of the weekend in 1.98s on Lap 22.\n\n- **[Straight Line] Max Speed Trap Delta** (*342.4 km/h*)\n  Top speed at speed trap registered by Williams at 342.4 km/h with DRS open, compared to field average of 334.1 km/h.\n\n### \u2694\ufe0f TEAMMATE HEAD-TO-HEAD BATTLES\n- **McLaren** (NOR vs PIA): Quali `7 - 5` | Race `8 - 4` -> Leader: **NOR (+15 pts)**\n- **Ferrari** (LEC vs HAM): Quali `8 - 4` | Race `7 - 5` -> Leader: **LEC (+13 pts)**\n- **Red Bull** (VER vs LAW): Quali `11 - 1` | Race `10 - 2` -> Leader: **VER (+98 pts)**\n- **Mercedes** (RUS vs ANT): Quali `9 - 3` | Race `8 - 4` -> Leader: **RUS (+42 pts)**\n"
